# testplan_test is the saolei template TEAM suite (spec
# 031-team-template-mode quickstart.md §2.1 / tasks.md Phase 8 T029): team
# lifecycle, TeamProfile CRUD, per-TeamProfile model, player-exclusive
# control, planner-trigger-per-game, planner long-term memory persistence +
# the calibration instruction scenarios (spec 039-planner-memory-calibration
# FR-014..FR-019), RefreshTeam, and per-agent message partitioning. It
# replaces the removed prompt / session-agent-lifecycle / per-profile-model
# suites. The target uses the gazelle default name ({package_name}_test) so
# gazelle does not regenerate a go_unittest (style/large_test.md).
#
# size = medium: the 037 optimize suite (specs/037-saolei-team-optimize
# FR-034) added TestTeamCompressionAtFiveGames, which drives 6 full games on
# one session (4 pre-compression + the compression game + a post-compression
# resume game) — beyond the 60s "small" budget alongside the other
# game-driving tests (style/large_test.md §测试用例: size per actual need).
go_largetest(
    name = "testplan_test",
